  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool2/). VERDICT: STALE-FIXED. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e. Decided and fixed by 416315836b (WI-famub, 2026-10-17): the module docstring 'REPOSITORY SCRIPTS VOTE TOO' rules a scripts/ gate a production caller, and production_source_files() includes Python under scripts/ (.py or python shebang). Live: it returns 98 scripts/ files; collect_production_references maps find_audit_findings_docs->scripts/check-audit-findings, supported_versions_label->scripts/refresh-stdlib-modules, find_discipline_drift, render_catalogues_markdown likewise; none of the 8 keys the item names is still among the baseline's 289 keys. MECHANISM: production_source_files scanned packages/*/src only; scripts/ gates now vote as production referencers. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-famub. PROPOSED DISPOSITION: close (awaiting owner authorization; status unchanged)."  # 0f92
